  "notes": "Cards are used to group and display content in a way that is easily readable.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/card/+page.md",
  "code": "<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start gap-3\">\n  <label class=\"card bg-accent text-accent-content\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"card-urgent-1\" />\n    <div class=\"card-body\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Urgent</h2>\n      <p>Same day delivery</p>\n    </div>\n  </label>\n\n  <div class=\"join bg-base-300 rounded-selector\">\n    <label class=\"join-item card\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" value=\"sm\" name=\"card-size-1\" />\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Size SM</h2>\n        <p>Available</p>\n      </div>\n    </label>\n\n    <label class=\"join-item card\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" value=\"md\" name=\"card-size-1\" disabled />\n      <div class=\"card-body opacity-60\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Size MD</h2>\n        <p>Not available</p>\n      </div>\n    </label>\n\n    <label class=\"join-item card\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" value=\"lg\" name=\"card-size-1\" />\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Size LG</h2>\n        <p>Short supply</p>\n      </div>\n    </label>\n  </div>\n</div>",
